    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d1299-a1">

                <pb facs="1112" n="1008" sameAs="frus:frus1913/pg1008"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure—Translation.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary for Foreign Affairs of Mexico to the
                        American Ambassador.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Foreign Office</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1913-05-19">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">May 19, 1913</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My Dear Mr. Wilson</hi>: Enclosed I have the honor
                    to transmit to your excellency a copy of the contract between Sr. Alberto Robles
                    Gil, Secretary of Fomento, Colonization and Industry, as the representative of
                    the Executive, and Mr. James Brown Potter, representative of the Compañía
                    Agrícola, Industrial, Colonizaclora, Limitada del Tlahualilo, S. A.</p>
                <p>The said contract will show your excellency the friendy disposition which the
                    Executive has to favor the company referred to in so far as is possible.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">F. L. de la Barra</hi>.</signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
